data/languages/R8C.slaspec is a derivative work of Ghidra's
Ghidra/Processors/M16C/data/languages/M16C_60.slaspec, developed by the
National Security Agency (NSA) and released under the Apache License 2.0
(https://github.com/NationalSecurityAgency/ghidra). Every change relative to
that file is marked with "[R8C fix]" / "[R8C]" comments and listed in
docs/TECHNICAL.md.

Instruction semantics were checked against the Renesas "R8C/Tiny Series
Software Manual" (REJ09B0001-0200 Rev.2.00) and the calling convention against
the Renesas "M16C Series, R8C Family C Compiler Package V.5.45 C Compiler
User's Manual" (REJ10J1995-0300). The manuals are NOT redistributed here.

The differential test (tests/difftest) downloads the GNU simulator sources
(binutils-gdb sim/m32c, GPL-3.0-or-later) at test time; they are not part of
this distribution. tests/difftest/sim/harness.c and
tests/difftest/sim/manual_fixes.py are GPL-3.0-or-later because they are built
together with those sources. Nothing from the test directory is included in
the extension zip.
